{'symbol': 'TPR', 'date': '2023-04-13 06:45:00', 'title': 'ALAN LAU JOINS TAPESTRY BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TAPESTRY, INC. (NYSE: TPR), A LEADING NEW YORK-BASED HOUSE OF ICONIC ACCESSORIES AND LIFESTYLE BRANDS CONSISTING OF COACH, KATE SPADE, AND STUART WEITZMAN, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ALAN LAU HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO TAPESTRY\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS. THE APPOINTMENT OF MR. LAU TO THE BOARD BRINGS THE MEMBERSHIP TO ELEVEN. JOANNE CREVOISERAT, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF TAPESTRY, INC., SAID, "WE ARE EXTREMELY PLEASED THAT ALAN LAU HAS AGREED TO JOIN OUR BOARD.'}